 "side": "Dark",
 "description": "FYI, this deck has yet to be played with.  I finally got around to posting this: a CCT deck with a slew of bounty hunters.",
 "strategy": "here's my idea on a quick filp. Use Any Methods Necesssary to pull JP:Dungeon, Boba(v), Boba's Gun(v) and ship(v). Then, deploy boba and gun, take Jabbas Prize, deploy Despair(v) with Boba's gun's text, and deploy JP:Dungeon from hand. Deploy CC:Docking Day with CCT. don't move, just draw. hope you either got He's All yours Bounty Hunter(v) in first hand or draw. then, next turn, deploy Tatooine:DB, deploy any other people in your hand to Dungeon. Play HAYBH, move boba to dungeon. Next turn, deploy Audeince Chamber, Jabba from reserve deck, and move boba to AC. flip, and cannot be placed out of play due to despair.\n\nThere really isnt much more to this deck. Battle, retrieve, battle, retrive, capture.  I know my space fleet is weak.  I'm working on it.  If anyone has Maul's Sith Infiltrator or Mist Hunter BB, email me at capyouintheface@juno.com",
